# .scratch/ is deliberately tracked: it holds the wayfinder map and the issue
# tracker, which are this project's decision record. Do not ignore it.

.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Harvested Waitrose orders hold real personal data — order numbers, the
# collection branch and postcode, collection windows, and a personal-care
# category. bin/browse.py reads them from disk and publishes a redacted view;
# the repo is public, so the sources stay out of it. Keep them here locally.
# Allowlist, not a pattern: a new order file is ignored by default, and adding
# one to the repo has to be a deliberate act.
Orders/*
!Orders/HARVEST.md
!Orders/history.md
